# Flag new behavior

New user-facing behavior is off by default behind a feature flag.

1. Define the flag in `pkg/services/featuremgmt/registry.go`.
2. Name it `grafana.<name>` (or the owning service prefix).
3. Set stage and `Generate` targets (`Go`, `React` as needed).
4. Run `make gen-feature-toggles`.
5. Wire the generated Go or React client; do not hand-edit `*_gen` files.

See `contribute/feature-toggles.md` and the skill `add-a-feature-flag`.
